WEBVTT

00:12:29.676 --> 00:12:34.116
“Alice in Wonderland”
symbolized curiosity,

00:12:34.116 --> 00:12:37.436
imagination and experiencing
the impossible.

00:12:38.396 --> 00:12:40.316
VR allows us to do the same.

00:12:41.316 --> 00:12:45.476
So here's my ask of every leader today.

00:12:45.516 --> 00:12:49.236
Let's put on our VR headsets
and follow that white rabbit.

00:12:49.236 --> 00:12:53.036
Let's chase our curiosity
to impossible places in the metaverse

00:12:53.076 --> 00:12:55.196
where anything can happen --

00:12:55.196 --> 00:12:59.196
and where we can solve humanity's
biggest problems together.